Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:01.37,Main,,0,0,0,,{\pos(485,1420)\fs40}Most movie heroes enter
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.37,0:00:02.52,Main,,0,0,0,,{\pos(485,1420)\fs40}with explosions and a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.52,0:00:03.46,Main,,0,0,0,,{\pos(485,1420)\fs40}superhero landing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.92,0:00:05.11,Main,,0,0,0,,{\pos(485,1420)\fs40}But Johnny Depp gave us
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.11,0:00:06.55,Main,,0,0,0,,{\pos(485,1420)\fs40}the most ridiculous entrance
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.55,0:00:07.44,Main,,0,0,0,,{\pos(485,1420)\fs40}in cinema history.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.94,0:00:09.27,Main,,0,0,0,,{\pos(485,1420)\fs40}He stands atop the mast
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.27,0:00:10.88,Main,,0,0,0,,{\pos(485,1420)\fs40}like a legendary pirate king,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.88,0:00:12.38,Main,,0,0,0,,{\pos(485,1420)\fs40}until the camera pans down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.76,0:00:13.24,Main,,0,0,0,,{\pos(485,1420)\fs40}It is a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.24,0:00:14.38,Main,,0,0,0,,{\pos(485,1420)\fs40}tiny, leaky rowboat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.66,0:00:15.96,Main,,0,0,0,,{\pos(485,1420)\fs40}And it is actively sinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.46,0:00:17.19,Main,,0,0,0,,{\pos(485,1420)\fs40}By the time he
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.19,0:00:18.10,Main,,0,0,0,,{\pos(485,1420)\fs40}reaches the harbor,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.10,0:00:19.07,Main,,0,0,0,,{\pos(485,1420)\fs40}the entire boat has
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.07,0:00:20.38,Main,,0,0,0,,{\pos(485,1420)\fs40}vanished beneath the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.70,0:00:21.71,Main,,0,0,0,,{\pos(485,1420)\fs40}Any normal pirate
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.71,0:00:22.88,Main,,0,0,0,,{\pos(485,1420)\fs40}would panic and swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.32,0:00:24.80,Main,,0,0,0,,{\pos(485,1420)\fs40}Not Captain Jack Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.20,0:00:26.37,Main,,0,0,0,,{\pos(485,1420)\fs40}At the exact second the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.37,0:00:27.30,Main,,0,0,0,,{\pos(485,1420)\fs40}mast hits the pier,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.30,0:00:28.32,Main,,0,0,0,,{\pos(485,1420)\fs40}he steps off without
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.32,0:00:29.64,Main,,0,0,0,,{\pos(485,1420)\fs40}even getting his boots wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.12,0:00:30.86,Main,,0,0,0,,{\pos(485,1420)\fs40}That is how you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.86,0:00:31.60,Main,,0,0,0,,{\pos(485,1420)\fs40}arrive in style.
